        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Kalman Steel Joists — American Builder, July 1935</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #4a4a4a;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px 0;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 960px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdfdfa;\n    padding: 45px 60px 40px 60px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 25px #000;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    font-size: 20px;\n  }\n  .header .folio { font-size: 20px; }\n  .header .mag { font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; font-size: 21px; }\n\n  .title-art {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 4px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .title-art .kalman-title {\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", Impact, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 76px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    color: #111;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #000;\n    transform: rotate(-6deg);\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin: 10px 0 0 0;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #ececec;\n    border: 1px dashed #888;\n    color: #444;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .main-illustration {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 620px;\n    margin: -30px auto 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .script-line {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Brush Script MT\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    font-size: 66px;\n    margin: 25px 0 25px 0;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 40px;\n    font-size: 18.5px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .columns .col { flex: 1; }\n  .columns p { margin: 0 0 2px 0; text-indent: 22px; }\n  .columns p.first { text-indent: 0; }\n  .dropcap {\n    font-size: 26px;\n  }\n  .smallcaps { font-variant: small-caps; }\n\n  .joist-figs {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 355px;\n    top: 1690px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 30px;\n  }\n  .fig { text-align: center; }\n  .fig .placeholder {\n    width: 175px;\n    height: 175px;\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    color: #ddd;\n    border: none;\n  }\n  .fig .cap {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .col-left .wrap-fig {\n    float: right;\n    shape-outside: content-box;\n    width: 215px;\n    height: 205px;\n    margin: 4px 0 0 12px;\n  }\n  .col-right .wrap-fig {\n    float: left;\n    width: 195px;\n    height: 205px;\n    margin: 4px 12px 0 0;\n  }\n\n  .brand {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", Impact, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 62px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 30px 0 0 0;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #000;\n  }\n\n  .footer-block {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 18px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .logo.placeholder {\n    width: 95px;\n    height: 90px;\n    flex: 0 0 95px;\n    background: #222;\n    color: #eee;\n    border: none;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .address {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    text-align: center;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .address i { font-style: italic; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"folio\">16</div>\n    <div class=\"mag\">American Builder, July 1935.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"title-art\">\n    <div class=\"kalman-title\">KALMAN STEEL JOISTS</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder main-illustration\">[Illustration: centered — man in suit standing behind three model houses with trees, arranged left, center and right]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"script-line\">bring added values to any home</div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <div class=\"col col-left\">\n      <p class=\"first\"><span class=\"dropcap\">W</span><span class=\"smallcaps\">hile</span> fire-safety ranks first among the advantages of Kalman Steel Joists, they bring additional values that appeal to any prospective home-builder.</p>\n      <p>The combination of Kalman Steel Joists with concrete floor slab and plaster makes a floor structure that, while forming an impassable barrier to fire, transmits very little sound and vibration, preventing noises overhead from disturbing occupants of rooms below. A floor structure that cannot shrink to cause cracks where walls and floor</p>\n      <div class=\"wrap-fig\"></div>\n      <p style=\"text-indent:0;\">meet, and that is immune to the dreaded termite, whose ravages are spreading rapidly.</p>\n      <p>These advantages, which make a difference in the building cost of only a few cents a square foot, provide the owner with a dwelling that is more</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col col-right\">\n      <p class=\"first\">livable. They make his investment sounder, because his home—which often represents the savings of years—is less subject to swift obsolescence, will need fewer repairs.</p>\n      <p>Kalman Steel Joists in no way complicate the builder's work. Often they simplify it. These joists require no cutting or fitting. They reach the site in the exact lengths needed and are quickly installed and the concrete poured.</p>\n      <p>Tell the prospective home-owner about the advantages of Kalman Steel Joists. The fact that he may have</p>\n      <div class=\"wrap-fig\"></div>\n      <p style=\"text-indent:0;\">in mind a relatively small dwelling offers no obstacle to their use. Kalman Joists can be applied as economically to a six-room home as to a large, pretentious one. They are of course adaptable to any style of architecture.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"joist-figs\">\n    <div class=\"fig\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Kalman joist]</div>\n      <div class=\"cap\">KALMAN JOIST</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fig\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Macmar joist]</div>\n      <div class=\"cap\">MACMAR JOIST</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"brand\">KALMAN BUILDING STEEL</div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-block\">\n    <div class=\"logo placeholder\">[Logo: BETHLEHEM STEEL]</div>\n    <div class=\"address\">\n      KALMAN STEEL CORPORATION, <i>Subsidiary of Bethlehem Steel Corporation. General Offices:</i> Bethlehem, Pa. <i>District Offices:</i> Albany,<br>\n      Atlanta, Baltimore, Boston, Buffalo, Chicago, Cincinnati, Cleveland, Detroit, Houston, Milwaukee, Minneapolis, New York, Philadelphia,<br>\n      Pittsburgh, St. Louis, St. Paul, Syracuse, Washington. <i>Pacific Coast Distributor:</i> Pacific Coast Steel Corporation, San Francisco, Seattle,<br>\n      Los Angeles, Portland, Honolulu. <i>Export Distributor:</i> Bethlehem Steel Export Corporation, New York.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
